Synopsis:  ls [args...]

Lists all files in long format with icons and hyperlinks. Uses eza,
falls back to lsd, then to system ls.

Arguments:
  args...  Arguments forwarded to the listing command

Example:
ls \[ti]/projects
ls
ls \-a \[ti]/projects
.EE
